# ~/.local/share/fedokawaii/wallpapers.list — the wallpaper pack: pictures fetched from
# GitHub (pinned commits, checked by SHA-256) by `kawa-wallpaper --pack` and kept as they
# came. On screen each is shown at full quality: reduced with a Lanczos filter to cover the
# monitor exactly (never enlarged: every one is at least as large as a 1080p screen, most
# as a 4K one) and cropped to it — from the middle, or towards the side "crop" names, for a
# picture whose subject sits high (north) or low (south).
# Each belongs to the dark or the light theme; "pair" names the same place in the other
# theme's light, and choosing one sets both.
# Nothing here is stored in the repository: the files are downloaded for your own use.
#
# Grouped by kind; the picker lists them in this order, the theme's default first.
#
# mode  name                 pair                 crop    sha256  url  credit (licence)

